logs#bound-the-interval","content":"Bound the interval"},"639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#identify-the-operation","content":"Identify the operation"},"640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#attribute-the-principal","content":"Attribute the principal"},"641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#compare-intent-and-result","content":"Compare intent and result"},"642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#follow-the-effect","content":"Follow the effect"},"643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#periodic-verification","content":"Periodic verification"},"644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","content":"Lamassu instruments the mutable operations of its services with audit events. Each event describes the operation, the principals that matched, the input, the result and whether it ended in error."},"645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"The audit body includes:"},"646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"input: data received by the operation;"},"647":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"has\\_error: whether the service returned an error;"},"648":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"output: produced result or error message;"},"649":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"principals: identifiers of the principals that matched the request."},"650":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"Successful operations use a type prefixed with audit.. Failures publish the operation type suffixed with .error. The CloudEvents event additionally adds source, identifier, date and type."},"651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#what-an-event-contains","content":"The middlewares publish the record after executing the operation, whether it succeeded or returned an error. This lets you investigate attempts as well as confirmed changes."},"652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"The backend applies auditing to mutations of:"},"653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"authorities, certificates and issuance profiles;"},"654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"keys and KMS engines;"},"655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"devices and identities;"},"656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"DMSs and enrollment operations;"},"657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"validation functions and CRL;"},"658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"principals, policies and authorization grants."},"659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#coverage","content":"Do not confuse these events with domain events. A domain event announces that a resource changed so another component can react; the audit event keeps input, output and principal context for investigation."},"660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"Services publish audit records to the event bus when their PublisherEventBus is enabled. The backend code does not, by itself, implement a queryable, durable audit file."},"661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"If you need retention, search, tamper protection or regulatory export, connect a consumer that persists the events into the system approved by your organization."},"662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"Design the consumer to:"},"663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"subscribe to the audit.# types and also to operation types ending in .error;"},"664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"keep the complete CloudEvent unmodified;"},"665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"record the ingestion time and detect duplicates by ID;"},"666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"encrypt in transit and at rest;"},"667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs#publication-and-persistence","content":"restrict reading and deletion to a role separate from the PKI operator;"},"668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/p