los publican el tipo de operación con sufijo .error. El evento CloudEvents añade, además, fuente, identificador, fecha y tipo."},"651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#qué-contiene-un-evento","content":"Los middlewares publican el registro después de ejecutar la operación, tanto si tuvo éxito como si devolvió un error. Esto permite investigar intentos además de cambios confirmados."},"652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"El backend aplica auditoría a mutaciones de:"},"653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"autoridades, certificados y perfiles de emisión;"},"654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"claves y motores KMS;"},"655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#cobertura","content":"dispositivos e identidades;"},"656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-previe