,"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#acota-el-intervalo","content":"Parte de la hora reportada y normaliza todas las fuentes a UTC."},"673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#identifica-la-operación","content":"Filtra por tipo de evento, fuente de servicio e identificador del recurso."},"674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#atribuye-el-principal","content":"Revisa principals y correlaciónalo con el proveedor OIDC o la identidad X.509 vigente en ese momento."},"675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#compara-intención-y-resultado","content":"Contrasta input, has\\_error y output. Un intento fallido no implica que el recurso haya cambiado."},"676":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#sigue-el-efecto","content":"Busca los eventos de dominio y registros del servicio que compartan recurso y ventana temporal. En una revocación de CA, incluye las operaciones en cascada."},"677":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"Genera una mutación controlada en un entorno de prueba y comprueba que:"},"678":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"aparece un evento de auditoría correcto;"},"679":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"el principal coincide con la identidad utilizada;"},"680":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"el consumidor lo persiste una sola vez;"},"681":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"puede recuperarse por recurso, actor y periodo;"},"682":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"una interrupción del consumidor produce una alerta."},"683":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/administration/audit-logs#verificación-periódica","content":"Para métricas, trazas y logs técnicos del despliegue, consulta Resolución de problemas. La auditoría responde a “quién intentó cambiar qué”; la observabilidad explica cómo se comportó el sistema."},"684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"page","content":"Arquitectura de la plataforma","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture"},"685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos."},"686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"Plano de control"},"687":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"Custodia y operaciones criptográficas"},"688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"Emisión y enrolamiento"},"689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Estado y validación"},"690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"Dependencias de la plataforma"},"691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Lamassu se despliega como un conjunto de servicios independientes. La separación evita que todos los componentes necesiten acceso directo a las claves privadas y permite escalar cada capacidad según la carga."},"692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","content":"Cambia al nivel bajo para ver el interior de la caja de la plataforma Lamassu (CA, KMS, DMS, Device Manager, VA, Alerts, el conector de AWS IoT, Job Manager y la consola/API), y al nivel medio para verla como una única plataforma junto a sus dependencias externas."},"693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"La consola y las APIs administran autoridades, certificados, DMS, dispositivos, alertas y configuración. Los eventos de dominio permiten que conectores y automatizaciones reaccionen a los cambios sin sondear continuamente la plataforma."},"694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"El KMS ofrece una interfaz común sobre motores software, PKCS#11 y proveedores cloud. El motor seleccionado conserva la clave o delega la operación criptográfica sin que los demás servicios conozcan su implementación."},"695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"El servicio de CA emite certificados y mantiene la relación con su autoridad. El DMS aplica las reglas de enrolamiento y expone los flujos EST para que un dispositivo solicite o renueve una identidad."},"696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Device Manager conserva la vista operativa del dispositivo y su historial. Validation Authority publica OCSP y CRLs para que otros sistemas decidan si deben confiar en un certificado presentado."},"697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"En un despliegue autogestionado, Lamassu utiliza PostgreSQL para persistencia, RabbitMQ para mensajería y un proveedor OIDC para autenticación. Consulta la arquitectura de despliegue para ver cómo se publican los servicios en Kubernetes."},"698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"page","content":"Cómo funciona Lamassu","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview"},"699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","content":"El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos."},"700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"El modelo en cinco piezas"},"701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Del alta a la operación"},"702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","content":"Lamassu conecta tres elementos: una **raíz de confianza**, una **política de emisión** y una **entidad que necesita demostrar su identidad**. La plataforma coordina esos elementos durante todo el ciclo de vida del certificado."},"703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Motor criptográfico.** Genera o custodia claves y ejecuta las operaciones privadas sin exponer el material criptográfico al resto de servicios."},"704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Autoridad de certificación (CA).** Firma certificados y establece la cadena de confianza."},"705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Device Management Service (DMS).** Define cómo se registran, autentican y renuevan los dispositivos de una flota."},"706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Dispositivo.** Conserva su clave privada y presenta el certificado para demostrar su identidad."},"707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Validation Authority (VA).** Publica el estado de los certificados mediante OCSP y CRL."},"708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un administrador configura un motor criptográfico y crea o importa una CA."},"709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un DMS relaciona esa CA con una política de enrolamiento."},"710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"El dispositivo genera una clave y solicita un certificado mediante EST, o un operador le asigna una identidad."},"711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Lamassu conserva el inventario, el historial y el estado de la identidad."},"712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Los consumidores comprueban la cadena y consultan OCSP o una CRL cuando necesitan conocer su vigencia."},"713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Arquitectura\" description=\"Conoce los componentes y dónde termina la responsabilidad de cada uno.\" href=\"/docs/platform/concepts/architecture\" />"},"714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Ciclo de vida de una identidad\" description=\"Sigue un certificado desde el enrolamiento hasta la renovación o revocación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle\" />"},"715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"page","content":"Dispositivos e identidades","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management"},"716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Registra, inspecciona y retira dispositivos comprobando su identidad actual y su historial."},"717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Estados del dispositivo"},"718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Inspecciona un dispositivo"},"719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#registra-un-dispositivo-manualmente","content":"Registra un dispositivo manualmente"},"720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#crea-el-dispositivo","content":"Crea el dispositivo"},"721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#define-su-pertenencia","content":"Define su pertenencia"},"722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#clasifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Clasifica el dispositivo"},"723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Verifica el alta"},"724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Asigna una identidad manualmente"},"725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"Revoca la identidad actual"},"726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Retira un dispositivo"},"727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"Automatiza el enrolamiento"},"728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Esta guía se dirige al operador de una flota. Necesitas permisos sobre dispositivos, DMS y certificados para las acciones que vayas a realizar. Una flota se organiza mediante esos recursos, etiquetas y metadatos; no se crea un objeto independiente de «flota»."},"729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","content":"Cada dispositivo tiene un `Device ID`, un DMS propietario (`dms_owner`) y, cuando está aprovisionado, un slot de identidad con una versión activa y versiones anteriores. En los flujos descritos, mantén el `Common Name` de la CSR y del certificado igual al `Device ID`: la vinculación utiliza ese CN para actualizar el dispositivo."},"730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Vista operativa"},"731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Interpretación"},"732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**No Identity**"},"733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Hay registro, pero todavía no hay identidad asociada."},"734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Active**"},"735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"El slot está activo; comprueba además las fechas, estado y usos del certificado."},"736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Renewal Pending**"},"737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad está en la ventana operativa de renovación."},"738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expiring Soon**"},"739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Se aproxima al vencimiento según los umbrales configurados."},"740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expired**"},"741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad ha vencido."},"742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Revoked**"},"743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"La identidad está marcada como revocada."},"744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Decommissioned**"},"745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"El registro está retirado y no vuelve al estado operativo mediante una actualización normal."},"746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"Los estados de dispositivo, slot y certificado son distintos. Los eventos y trabajos pueden actualizar la vista después de guardar el certificado; una etiqueta **Active** no prueba aceptación por un consumidor."},"747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Filtra el inventario por ID, etiquetas y estado. Abre el detalle y registra DMS propietario, versión activa y serie del certificado actual."},"748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Certificate History** relaciona versiones anteriores y actuales. Sustituir el slot no revoca por sí solo todas las versiones anteriores."},"749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Device Event Timeline** ayuda a reconstruir altas, aprovisionamientos, renovaciones y cambios de estado. Un cambio puede haberse guardado aunque falle la persistencia de su evento; contrasta también el registro y los certificados."},"750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Compara esos datos con la identidad instalada en el dispositivo. Un slot actualizado en Lamassu no instala archivos en el equipo remoto."},"751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#registra-un-dispositivo-manualmente","content":"Utiliza este flujo para preparar inventario o asignar una identidad desde la consola. Necesitas un DMS existente."},"752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#crea-el-dispositivo","content":"Desde **Managed Devices**, abre el registro. Confirma que el ID no exista en otro DMS: la búsqueda por ID no está limitada a una flota."},"753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#define-su-pertenencia","content":"Introduce el **Device ID** y selecciona el DMS que será su propietario. La etiqueta **Registration Authority** de la consola se refiere a ese DMS."},"754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#clasifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Añade icono y etiquetas de modelo, entorno o ubicación según tu inventario."},"755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Vuelve a leer el dispositivo: debe tener el DMS previsto y estar en **No Identity**. Sigue Registro manual para completar la asignación."},"756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#verifica-el-alta","content":"Prerregistrar no demuestra que `/simpleenroll` vaya a admitir la solicitud. Revisa la interacción con `enable_replaceable_enrollment` en Estrategias de aprovisionamiento."},"757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Desde **No Identity**, utiliza **Assign Identity**:"},"758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Elige un certificado activo, vigente y adecuado para el consumidor, con `CN` exactamente igual al `Device ID`."},"759":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Si no existe, **Issue New Instead** permite iniciar una emisión con la CA prevista. Revisa primero el perfil."},"760":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Confirma y vuelve a consultar serie, versión activa e historial."},"761":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Instala la pareja clave/certificado y las intermedias necesarias en el dispositivo, y prueba su uso."},"762":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#asigna-una-identidad-manualmente","content":"Emitir, vincular e instalar son pasos distintos. Si falla la operación, comprueba cuáles se guardaron antes de repetirla."},"763":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"Localiza la serie activa en el historial y revócala con una razón apropiada. Comprueba registro, publicación OCSP/CRL y rechazo de una conexión nueva en el consumidor con la guía de certificados."},"764":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#revoca-la-identidad-actual","content":"La revocación no elimina el dispositivo. Tampoco habilita automáticamente una nueva inscripción: la recuperación depende de su credencial, estado y política DMS. `CertificateHold` puede reactivarse bajo las condiciones de PKI; otras razones bloquean cambios posteriores del certificado."},"765":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Antes de **Decommission**, inventaría identidades activas y anteriores, conexiones y permisos del destino. Prepara su retirada en el consumidor."},"766":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"El backend guarda **Decommissioned** e intenta revocar el certificado de la versión activa con `CessationOfOperation` si el slot no estaba expirado o revocado. No recorre todo el historial. La revocación diferida puede fallar después de guardar la baja; verifica su resultado por serie."},"767":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"El estado retirado protege las actualizaciones normales del dispositivo y su slot. No constituye una garantía de que toda solicitud EST sea rechazada antes de emitir: la vinculación puede omitir un dispositivo retirado sin devolver error. Confirma que no quedan certificados o permisos utilizables y bloquea nuevas admisiones en el control correspondiente."},"768":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#retira-un-dispositivo","content":"Conserva los registros según tu política de auditoría. No reutilices un ID retirado para ocultar el cambio de equipo."},"769":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Enrola y conecta un dispositivo\" description=\"Obtén una identidad desde el cliente y prueba mTLS.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device\" />"},"770":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/device-management#automatiza-el-enrolamiento","content":"<Card title=\"Renovación y recuperación\" description=\"Instala el sucesor y trata fallos sin perder el estado conocido.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery\" />"},"771":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"page","content":"Identidad inicial y autenticación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity"},"772":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll."},"773":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"Confianza inicial del servidor"},"774":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Credencial bootstrap"},"775":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Modos por operación"},"776":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Contrato del webhook"},"777":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"Revocación y comprobaciones"},"778":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","content":"Esta guía conecta al administrador DMS con quien fabrica o integra el dispositivo. Antes de solicitar su identidad operativa, el cliente debe poder autenticar al servidor EST y demostrar que tiene derecho a solicitar el ID previsto."},"779":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"Instala una raíz, cadena o pin previamente verificado mediante un canal confiable: fabricación, configuración aprobada o distribución autenticada. Ese material permite verificar TLS y el nombre del servidor antes de descargar `/cacerts`."},"780":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#confianza-inicial-del-servidor","content":"No puedes obtener tu única prueba de confianza del mismo servidor todavía no autenticado. El certificado TLS del servidor EST, el certificado bootstrap y la CA emisora de la identidad operativa pueden pertenecer a jerarquías distintas."},"781":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Con `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, el dispositivo presenta su certificado inicial y demuestra posesión de su clave en TLS. El DMS lo valida frente a sus CAs de admisión. En el flujo examinado, el validador recibe una credencial de hoja: configura y prueba el emisor directo para el caso sencillo; enviar más intermedias desde el cliente no demuestra que lleguen al servicio."},"782":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"Comprueba fechas, certificado y clave correspondientes y estado de revocación antes de provisionarlos. Una credencial compartida entre equipos identifica esa credencial compartida, no a un equipo concreto."},"783":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#credencial-bootstrap","content":"En el primer enrolamiento, la validación mTLS no compara por sí sola el CN del bootstrap con el CN solicitado en la CSR. Si necesitas que un solicitante solo pueda pedir su propio `Device ID`, añade un control que vincule credencial e ID, por ejemplo el webhook combinado, y prueba una solicitud con otro CN. En reenrolamiento con certificado sí se compara su CN con el de la CSR; las comprobaciones posteriores utilizan la identidad activa registrada."},"784":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Los cuatro modos se seleccionan independientemente para enrolamiento y reenrolamiento en DMS. La credencial utilizada al renovar depende de ese bloque; no presupongas que siempre será el bootstrap o que el webhook desaparezca."},"785":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#modos-por-operación","content":"Un token OIDC de administración no es un modo EST nativo. Un webhook puede interpretar una cabecera de credencial que acuerdes con él; en ese caso la autorización la realiza ese servicio. En NO\\_AUTH, enviar un token no añade autenticación al DMS."},"786":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"El DMS envía el contexto de la operación al servicio configurado. El método procede de la configuración; acuerda su contrato antes de seleccionar POST o PUT. La espera de autorización tiene un valor inicial de 10 segundos, sustituido por un timeout positivo configurado. El DMS verifica el certificado del receptor salvo que se active `insecure_skip_verify` en la configuración del webhook — por defecto se verifica — y no sigue redirecciones, así que la URL configurada debe ser la final. La respuesta de autorización debe ser JSON de como máximo 1 MiB. Con la autenticación de Lamassu hacia el webhook configurada sobre `http://`, la API key o el bearer token viajan en texto claro, y mTLS no tiene efecto porque no hay handshake TLS, así que el certificado de cliente nunca se presenta; prefiere `https://`. Configura esas opciones en los ajustes del webhook externo de la guía DMS."},"787":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Ejemplo de cuerpo:"},"788":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"`csr` contiene **base64 del PEM**, a diferencia del cuerpo EST, que contiene base64 del DER. `http_request` recoge URL y primeras entradas de cabeceras del contexto HTTP disponible. El campo `operation` no se envía en este cuerpo; distingue enroll y reenroll mediante la ruta y la política configurada."},"789":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"El webhook debe verificar la credencial, su relación con `device_cn`, DMS, operación y política de admisión. Las cabeceras transportadas no son por sí mismas evidencia de confianza. La autenticación de **Lamassu hacia el webhook** es otra relación distinta que se configura en el cliente HTTP del servidor."},"790":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"La continuación requiere respuesta HTTP satisfactoria y JSON:"},"791":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#contrato-del-webhook","content":"Un `204` sin cuerpo no cumple el contrato. Rechazo, error de transporte, respuesta no interpretable o timeout abortan la autorización. En modo combinado, primero se valida el certificado y después se consulta el webhook. Consulta la especificación del webhook."},"792":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"El DMS busca primero el certificado en Lamassu; para uno externo intenta OCSP y CRL. Si no logra comprobar revocación, los validadores pueden continuar tratándolo como no revocado. El código tampoco permite asumir que todo estado externo distinto de Good se rechace. Verifica el comportamiento requerido con tu credencial y endpoint reales; no presentes esta comprobación como una política estricta garantizada para todas las fuentes."},"793":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity#revocación-y-comprobaciones","content":"Prueba certificado permitido, certificado incorrecto, CN ajeno, webhook denegado, timeout y reenrolamiento bajo su propia política. Conserva el resultado y programa la retirada de las credenciales bootstrap cuando corresponda. Continúa con Cliente EST."},"794":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"page","content":"Configura y opera el DMS","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms"},"795":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida."},"796":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"797":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-un-dms","content":"Configura un DMS"},"798":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Identifica la flota"},"799":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Selecciona la CA de enrolamiento"},"800":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Configura EST"},"801":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Distribuye la confianza"},"802":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Verifica los endpoints"},"803":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-enrollment","content":"Configuración de enrollment"},"804":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"Enrollment Device Registration"},"805":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Enrollment Settings"},"806":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Autenticación por operación"},"807":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Ajustes del webhook externo"},"808":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#perfil-de-emisión","content":"Perfil de emisión"},"809":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Configuración de re-enrollment"},"810":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"811":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Distribución de confianza"},"812":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"Opera el inventario de DMS"},"813":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Integra los dispositivos"},"814":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","content":"Un &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** configura la admisión y el ciclo de identidad de sus dispositivos. Actúa como autoridad de registro; la CA indicada en `Enrollment CA` firma los certificados. Esta guía se dirige a quien administra esa política."},"815":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas permisos para gestionar DMS, una CA activa con clave utilizable y un perfil de emisión probado. Acuerda con el integrador ID del dispositivo, credencial inicial, consumidor y ventana de renovación. Revisa la estrategia de aprovisionamiento antes de elegir registro y sustitución."},"816":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara confianza del servidor EST y acceso desde el dispositivo con Despliegue. La autenticación administrativa de tu operador no sustituye la autenticación EST del dispositivo."},"817":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#identifica-la-flota","content":"Crea el DMS con un nombre reconocible y conserva su ID. Las URLs EST utilizan ese identificador, no el nombre visible. Cada dispositivo conserva un DMS propietario."},"818":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige **Enrollment CA** y un perfil explícito apropiado para la identidad final. Mantén CN compatible con `Device ID`. El certificado de prueba debe permitir el uso previsto y terminar dentro de la vigencia del emisor."},"819":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configura-est","content":"Selecciona registro y autenticación del primer enrolamiento. Configura por separado la autenticación de reenrolamiento, sus umbrales y la retirada del certificado anterior. Deja ServerKeyGen deshabilitado si el cliente genera su clave."},"820":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Selecciona los certificados que devolverá `/cacerts`. Incluye explícitamente las intermedias y raíces necesarias, sin confundir distribución con instalación automática de confianza."},"821":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Guarda y vuelve a leer la configuración. Consulta `/cacerts`, realiza un enrolamiento permitido y otro rechazado, y comprueba dispositivo, serie e historial. Crear el DMS o descargar cacerts no demuestra que autenticación y emisión funcionen."},"822":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.registration_mode` permite `JITP` o `PRE_REGISTRATION`. En JITP se crea el dispositivo desconocido con el CN de la CSR como ID y el DMS como propietario. El `device_provisioning_profile` aporta etiquetas, metadatos e icono a ese alta."},"823":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-device-registration","content":"En PRE\\_REGISTRATION, el ID debe existir previamente. En el código examinado, un dispositivo existente pasa antes por el control de sustitución, incluso si no tiene identidad. Consulta las condiciones de prerregistro antes de utilizar este modo."},"824":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Campo de `settings.enrollment_settings`"},"825":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Decisión"},"826":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`protocol`"},"827":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`EST_RFC7030` para estas operaciones."},"828":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enrollment_ca`"},"829":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"ID de la CA que firmará."},"830":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`verify_csr_signature`"},"831":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Mantén `true` para comprobar posesión de la clave de la CSR."},"832":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`enable_replaceable_enrollment`"},"833":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Permite `/simpleenroll` para un ID existente del mismo DMS. Puede intentar revocar el anterior incluso si falla una fase posterior; no es un cambio atómico."},"834":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"`est_rfc7030_settings.auth_mode`"},"835":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Uno de los cuatro modos de autenticación."},"836":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#enrollment-settings","content":"Si el ID pertenece a otro DMS, el enrolamiento inicial se rechaza. No actives sustitución como respuesta automática a un error; el diagnóstico distingue ID repetido, propiedad y cambios parciales."},"837":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Los bloques son independientes:"},"838":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`settings.enrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` para `/simpleenroll` y `/serverkeygen`."},"839":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`settings.reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings` para `/simplereenroll`."},"840":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`auth_mode`"},"841":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Control aplicado en la operación configurada"},"842":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`"},"843":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Validación del certificado presentado."},"844":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"845":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Autorización del webhook configurado."},"846":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`CLIENT_CERTIFICATE_AND_EXTERNAL_WEBHOOK`"},"847":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Validación del certificado y, después, aprobación del webhook."},"848":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"`NO_AUTH`"},"849":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Sin autenticación del solicitante por el DMS."},"850":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Webhook y modo combinado también se ejecutan en reenrolamiento si se configuran en su bloque. No hay una degradación implícita a NO\\_AUTH en esos casos. Un modo ausente o no reconocido falla."},"851":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Para mTLS inicial, `client_certificate_settings` contiene `validation_cas`, `allow_expired` y `chain_level_validation`. El flujo examinado recibe una credencial de certificado, no garantiza transportar todas las intermedias del handshake al validador. Para el caso directo, configura como CA de validación el emisor directo del bootstrap y prueba la ruta real del Gateway."},"852":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"En reenrolamiento con certificado, el validador utiliza la CA de enrolamiento, después `additional_validation_cas`, y la opción `enable_expired_renewal`. No presupongas que copiar `validation_cas` del bloque inicial cambia esos emisores."},"853":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#autenticación-por-operación","content":"Para el webhook, configura destino, autenticación de Lamassu hacia ese servicio, método y timeout. El contrato de autenticación explica la credencial del dispositivo y el cuerpo de la llamada. `NO_AUTH` no acredita propiedad del ID solicitado."},"854":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Los modos de autenticación por webhook leen `external_webhook_settings` en el mismo bloque `est_rfc7030_settings`:"},"855":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Campo de `external_webhook_settings`"},"856":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Decisión"},"857":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`url`"},"858":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"URL absoluta `http` o `https` del receptor. Debe ser la URL final; no se siguen redirecciones."},"859":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`method`"},"860":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`POST` o `PUT`; `POST` por defecto."},"861":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`name`"},"862":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Etiqueta usada en los logs del servicio."},"863":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.auth_mode`"},"864":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`noauth`, `apikey`, `jwt` o `mtls`. Un valor ausente o desconocido se comporta como `noauth`."},"865":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.apikey_options`"},"866":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Obligatorios para `apikey`: `header` y `key`. Los nombres de cabecera reservados se rechazan."},"867":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.jwt_options`"},"868":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Obligatorios para `jwt`: `oidc_client_id`, `oidc_client_secret` y un `oidc_well_known` absoluto `http` o `https`."},"869":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.mtls_options`"},"870":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Obligatorios para `mtls`: `cert_content` y `key_content` como PEM en línea."},"871":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.insecure_skip_verify`"},"872":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Con `true`, omite la verificación del certificado del receptor. Por defecto se verifica. A diferencia de los canales de alertas, este ajuste se respeta aquí."},"873":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"`config.call_timeout`"},"874":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Duración máxima de la llamada de autorización (por ejemplo `10s`); 10 segundos por defecto."},"875":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Reglas de esa configuración:"},"876":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Crear o actualizar un DMS cuyo `auth_mode` de enrolamiento o reenrolamiento use el webhook valida el bloque y devuelve HTTP 400 — el cuerpo empieza por `struct validation error:` y continúa con `invalid enrollment external webhook config` o `invalid reenrollment external webhook config` — cuando la URL, el método o las opciones no son válidos. Las referencias a archivos (`ca_cert_file`, `mtls_options.cert_file`, `mtls_options.key_file`) siempre son inválidas: el servicio no lee archivos, así que entrega el PEM como `mtls_options.cert_content` y `key_content`."},"877":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Un `apikey_options.header` propio no puede usar nombres en los que la plataforma o el servicio receptor confían — por ejemplo `X-Principal-Id`, `X-Request-Id`, `Host`, `Content-Type` o `Forwarded` — y ningún nombre puede empezar por `X-Forwarded-`, `X-Envoy-` o `X-Lms-` (sin distinguir mayúsculas). La referencia de la API DMS documenta los esquemas `WebhookCall` y `WebhookCallHttpClient` y que las cabeceras API-key reservadas se rechazan."},"878":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"La clave anidada `http_client` existe solo en las configuraciones de canales de alertas; en un cuerpo de DMS se ignora. La clave de DMS es `external_webhook_settings.config`."},"879":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"La API ignora los campos heredados `validate_server_cert`, `apikey`, `oidc` y `mtls`. Un cuerpo con `config.auth_mode` establecido a `apikey`, `jwt` o `mtls` que aún solo contenga los campos de opción heredados (`apikey`, `oidc`, `mtls`) falla la validación con 400; solo se aceptan cuerpos heredados `noauth`, y sus credenciales se descartan."},"880":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"La respuesta de autorización debe ser JSON de como máximo 1 MiB; un cuerpo mayor hace fallar la llamada."},"881":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"Si hay credenciales configuradas, se envían sea cual sea el esquema de la URL: un webhook `http://` recibe la API key o el bearer token en claro, y mTLS no tiene efecto porque no hay handshake TLS, así que el certificado de cliente nunca se presenta. Usa preferentemente `https://` en `url`, en `oidc_well_known` y en el endpoint de token que este anuncia."},"882":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"La migración `20260604110000` copia la autenticación inicial al bloque de renovación si este falta y existe la estructura necesaria. No sustituye una configuración ya presente. Después de actualizar, lee ambos bloques; si la consola de tu versión no expone la configuración independiente, utiliza la API DMS."},"883":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#ajustes-del-webhook-externo","content":"La migración `20261021120000` reescribe todas las configuraciones de webhook almacenadas con este formato: `validate_server_cert` pasa a ser `insecure_skip_verify` negado (una configuración con `validate_server_cert` a false sigue sin verificar el certificado), `oidc` pasa a ser `jwt_options`, `apikey` pasa a ser `apikey_options` y `mtls` pasa a ser `mtls_options`. Cuando el certificado y la clave heredados son ambos PEM, se trasladan a `mtls_options.cert_content` y `key_content` y no requieren ninguna acción. En cualquier otro caso, incluida una configuración mixta (certificado PEM y clave como ruta de fichero), ambos valores pasan a `mtls_options.cert_file` y `key_file`. La entrega rechaza cualquier configuración de webhook que haga referencia a ficheros, sea cual sea su modo de autenticación, por lo que todos los enroll y reenroll que llaman a ese webhook fallan hasta que el certificado y la clave se vuelvan a introducir como contenido PEM, o se eliminen los campos de fichero sobrantes si el webhook no usa mTLS. Si la consola de tu versión no muestra esos campos, edita el DMS mediante la API de DMS."},"884":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#perfil-de-emisión","content":"`settings.issuance_profile_id` tiene precedencia sobre `settings.issuance_profile`; si ninguno existe, se utiliza el perfil predeterminado de la CA. Las reglas se documentan una sola vez en Perfiles. Cambiar un DMS afecta a solicitudes futuras; no modifica certificados ya firmados ni instala confianza en clientes."},"885":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Campo de `settings.reenrollment_settings`"},"886":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Función"},"887":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`reenrollment_delta`"},"888":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"La ventana abre en `NotAfter` del certificado activo menos este delta."},"889":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`preventive_delta`"},"890":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Umbral operativo preventivo de monitorización."},"891":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`critical_delta`"},"892":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Umbral operativo crítico de monitorización."},"893":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`enable_expired_renewal`"},"894":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Aceptación de un certificado presentado vencido en el validador mTLS de renovación. No autoriza por sí solo otro modo ni elimina restricciones del Gateway."},"895":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`additional_validation_cas`"},"896":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Emisores adicionales para la credencial mTLS durante una migración."},"897":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"`revoke_on_reenrollment`"},"898":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Si el certificado anterior está ACTIVE, intenta revocarlo con Superseded antes de vincular el sucesor."},"899":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#configuración-de-re-enrollment","content":"Monitorizar no renueva: el cliente debe programar la solicitud y la instalación. En modos webhook o NO\\_AUTH, la política de credencial vencida no pasa por el mismo validador mTLS; el webhook debe autorizar explícitamente la recuperación que admita. Revisa Renovación y recuperación para orden de operaciones y fallos parciales."},"900":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#serverkeygen","content":"`settings.server_keygen_settings.enabled` habilita generación software en el servidor. Algoritmo y tamaño proceden de su campo `key`; el perfil de emisión debe permitirlos. La respuesta contiene una clave PKCS#8 sin cifrar dentro de TLS, además del certificado. Consulta formato y extracción en Referencia EST."},"901":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Opción"},"902":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Qué publica"},"903":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA**"},"904":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificado TLS downstream disponible; puede ser una hoja, no una CA de emisión."},"905":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Enrollment CA**"},"906":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificado de la CA emisora seleccionada."},"907":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Managed CAs**"},"908":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"Certificados de las CAs elegidas explícitamente."},"909":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#distribución-de-confianza","content":"No se añaden todos los ascendientes automáticamente. La distribución de confianza distingue raíces confiables, intermedias y confianza inicial del servidor."},"910":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Edit** cambia nombre, ajustes y metadatos. La actualización del backend sustituye esos bloques completos; al usar la API, lee el DMS antes de enviar una edición para no perder campos."},"911":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Go to DMS owned devices** limita el inventario al propietario. **Show/Edit Metadata** contiene datos operativos y de integraciones; consulta su guía antes de alterarlos. &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** ayuda a localizar las URLs."},"912":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#opera-el-inventario-de-dms","content":"**Delete** elimina el registro y la configuración del DMS; no realiza por sí solo una cascada de revocación sobre todos sus dispositivos y certificados. Migra dependencias y conserva las referencias de auditoría antes de retirarlo."},"913":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms#integra-los-dispositivos","content":"Continúa con Cliente EST o el tutorial de enrolamiento y mTLS. La Referencia EST recoge formatos; Diagnóstico recoge fallos."},"914":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"page","content":"Integra el cliente EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client"},"915":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida."},"916":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"917":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"Descarga e inspecciona cacerts"},"918":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"Prepara la CSR"},"919":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Solicita la identidad"},"920":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Comprueba e instala el resultado"},"921":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#siguientes-pasos","content":"Siguientes pasos"},"922":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","content":"Esta guía es para quien implementa el cliente del dispositivo. El administrador debe haber preparado la política DMS. Para una primera ejecución completa, sigue Enrola y conecta tu primer dispositivo."},"923":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas el URL HTTPS público del DMS, la confianza del servidor obtenida por un canal aprobado, el modo de autenticación de la operación y un identificador admitido. Los ejemplos usan Bash, OpenSSL 3.x y curl con `--fail-with-body`; utiliza un directorio privado de trabajo y una versión compatible de esas herramientas."},"924":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Prepara `est-trust.pem` para verificar al servidor EST, `bootstrap.crt` y `bootstrap.key` para la autenticación inicial por certificado, y `device-root.pem` como raíz aprobada del emisor de dispositivos. Los dos archivos de confianza pueden contener raíces distintas. Si usas otra autenticación, adapta las credenciales según Identidad inicial."},"925":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#antes-de-empezar","content":"Sustituye el host y `REPLACE_DMS_ID` por los de tu instalación. El APS del URL es el identificador del DMS, no su nombre visible."},"926":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"El contenido predeterminado es PKCS#7 DER codificado en Base64. No es un archivo PEM directo."},"927":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#descarga-e-inspecciona-cacerts","content":"Comprueba las huellas, emisores y fechas frente a la política de distribución de confianza. La respuesta puede contener una selección de CAs y el certificado TLS de Lamassu. No conviertas todo el contenido en raíces confiables ni lo utilices para autenticar la misma descarga inicial. Un HTTP 200 aquí no demuestra que la autenticación ni la emisión funcionen."},"928":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"El ejemplo genera una clave EC P-256 nueva y usa `est-device-001`, que debe estar libre si el DMS registra automáticamente. El `Common Name` será el identificador del dispositivo. Comprueba que el perfil permite la clave y el sujeto elegidos."},"929":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#prepara-la-csr","content":"Una implementación con hardware o almacén propio debe producir la CSR mediante su clave residente. `simpleenroll` envía la solicitud y conserva la clave en el cliente. Honor Extensions no autoriza todos los atributos pedidos: consulta Perfiles."},"930":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Con autenticación inicial `CLIENT_CERTIFICATE`, envía la CSR DER en Base64 con `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`:"},"931":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#solicita-la-identidad","content":"Detén el proceso si curl falla. Conserva el código HTTP, cabeceras y cuerpo para el diagnóstico; una respuesta de error no se decodifica como certificado. El ejemplo Bash se detiene antes de esa conversión. Un timeout deja el resultado de la operación por comprobar en Lamassu: no repitas automáticamente una emisión."},"932":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Para el caso de una raíz que emite directamente:"},"933":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Verifica además que el CN es el esperado, el certificado es final, los usos permiten tu aplicación y las fechas satisfacen el perfil. `cmp` debe terminar con código 0. Si hay intermedias, aporta la cadena con `-untrusted` según Validación PKI."},"934":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#comprueba-e-instala-el-resultado","content":"Consulta el dispositivo: DMS propietario, número de serie actual e historial deben corresponder al resultado. Guarda la pareja clave/certificado de forma protegida e instala ambos mediante el mecanismo del dispositivo. La asociación en Lamassu no instala archivos en el cliente. Comprueba una conexión real antes de considerar terminado el proceso."},"935":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client#siguientes-pasos","content":"Implementa renovación y recuperación y la actualización de confianza. La referencia EST recoge endpoints, formatos y ServerKeyGen; el diagnóstico ayuda a distinguir errores de transporte, admisión y persistencia."},"936":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"page","content":"Referencia EST","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference"},"937":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu."},"938":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Referencia de endpoints"},"939":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"cacerts"},"940":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"simpleenroll"},"941":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"simplereenroll"},"942":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"serverkeygen"},"943":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Formato de respuesta"},"944":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Solicitud y extracción"},"945":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Notas de compatibilidad"},"946":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","content":"Referencia del contrato del backend examinado, basada en RFC 7030. Utiliza Cliente EST para el procedimiento y DMS para configurar la política."},"947":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Ruta pública de los ejemplos: `/.well-known/est/{APS}/{operation}`. `APS` es el ID del DMS. El router admite rutas sin ese segmento, pero el controlador lo requiere; no las utilices como servicio predeterminado. La configuración del Gateway determina el host y la ruta públicos."},"948":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Operación"},"949":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Método"},"950":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación y condición"},"951":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/cacerts`"},"952":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"GET"},"953":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"La lectura DMS no exige credencial EST; HTTPS y controles de infraestructura siguen aplicándose."},"954":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/simpleenroll`"},"955":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"956":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación inicial y política de registro/sustitución del DMS."},"957":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/simplereenroll`"},"958":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"959":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación de renovación, identidad existente, sujeto, revocación y ventana."},"960":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"`/serverkeygen`"},"961":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"POST"},"962":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Autenticación y admisión iniciales; generación en servidor habilitada."},"963":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#referencia-de-endpoints","content":"Estas rutas no implementan `/csrattrs` ni `/fullcmc`. No hay un modo EST nativo de autenticación JWT; un webhook puede interpretar una credencial de la petición según su propio contrato."},"964":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"La respuesta predeterminada tiene `Content-Type: application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only` y `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64`. El cuerpo es PKCS#7 DER en Base64 con líneas de hasta 76 caracteres. Incluye los certificados seleccionados por el DMS, no necesariamente todos los ascendientes."},"965":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#cacerts","content":"`Accept: application/x-pem-file` solicita el conjunto en PEM mediante una extensión de Lamassu. Su contenido debe inspeccionarse y aprobarse antes de modificar raíces confiables."},"966":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"Envía una CSR PKCS#10 DER codificada en Base64, con `Content-Type: application/pkcs10`. El controlador examinado compara ese media type literalmente; evita añadir parámetros como charset. El CN identifica el dispositivo y la firma de la CSR debe verificarse mediante la política DMS."},"967":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simpleenroll","content":"La respuesta predeterminada usa el formato PKCS#7/Base64 descrito para cacerts, pero contiene el certificado emitido; no presupongas que incluye toda su cadena. `Accept: application/x-pem-file` devuelve ese certificado en PEM. El cliente conserva la clave que firmó la CSR."},"968":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"Usa el mismo formato de solicitud y de certificado de respuesta. La autenticación se obtiene del bloque independiente `reenrollment_settings.est_rfc7030_settings`. Con certificado cliente, su CN debe coincidir con el CN de la CSR; también se comprueba el sujeto frente al certificado actual."},"969":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#simplereenroll","content":"La CA de enrolamiento o una CA adicional valida la credencial en el modo mTLS. La comprobación de vencimiento por `enable_expired_renewal` corresponde a ese validador. El certificado actual revocado y una solicitud anterior a la ventana se rechazan. Consulta Renovación para instalación y recuperación."},"970":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"El servidor genera una clave software, reconstruye la CSR con esa clave y ejecuta el enrolamiento inicial. El flag debe estar habilitado y el algoritmo permitido por el perfil. La clave de esta operación no pasa a ser una clave hardware por utilizar una CA alojada en HSM."},"971":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#serverkeygen","content":"El código admite RSA y ECDSA de 224, 256, 384 o 521 bits. Un tamaño ECDSA no reconocido puede producir fallback a 256; elige explícitamente un tamaño compatible y comprueba la clave resultante. No reutilices un ID enrolado para probar esta operación sin revisar sustitución."},"972":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"El cuerpo es **MIME multipart/mixed**, con boundary indicado en `Content-Type`. Tiene dos partes:"},"973":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Parte"},"974":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Contenido tras decodificar su Base64"},"975":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"`application/pkcs8`"},"976":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"Clave privada PKCS#8 DER sin cifrar."},"977":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"`application/pkcs7-mime; smime-type=certs-only`"},"978":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"PKCS#7 DER con el certificado emitido."},"979":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#formato-de-respuesta","content":"El controlador también añade `Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64` en la cabecera exterior, aunque el cuerpo exterior es texto MIME. &#x2A;*No decodifiques el cuerpo completo como Base64.** Lee el boundary real y decodifica cada parte según sus cabeceras."},"980":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"En una sesión Bash con `set -euo pipefail` y `umask 077`, utiliza `EST_BASE` y los archivos de confianza/bootstrap de Cliente EST. Elige `est-serverkeygen-001` libre y admitido. La clave `server-request.key` solo firma la CSR de entrada; la identidad recibida utilizará la clave generada por el servidor."},"981":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Guarda este extractor Python 3. Valida las dos partes antes de escribir y rechaza archivos de salida existentes:"},"982":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Convierte y comprueba el resultado:"},"983":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#solicitud-y-extracción","content":"Inspecciona CN, serie, fechas y usos; comprueba la asociación en Lamassu antes de instalar. Protege los archivos DER y PEM que contienen la clave y elimina copias temporales según el almacenamiento del dispositivo. Consulta openssl-pkcs8 y el parser MIME de Python."},"984":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"No interpretes cualquier 500 como un fallo transitorio. La entrada inválida suele producir 400; rechazos y errores del servicio suelen producir 500 con un cuerpo JSON `err`. Los errores de Gateway y algunos caminos del controlador pueden tener otro formato. Conserva cabeceras y cuerpo antes de decodificar y consulta el diagnóstico."},"985":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Los ejemplos utilizan openssl-pkcs7 para extraer certificados y openssl-x509 para preparar renovación. Comprueba capacidades y respuestas de tu versión antes de integrar un cliente EST genérico."},"986":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"page","content":"Enrolamiento con PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Dispositivos e identidades","Enrolamiento con PKI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview"},"987":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST."},"988":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El recorrido"},"989":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"Para el administrador"},"990":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-integrador","content":"Para el integrador"},"991":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#versión-del-contrato","content":"Versión del contrato"},"992":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","content":"Enrollment with PKI reúne el recorrido desde la admisión del dispositivo hasta la instalación y renovación de su identidad. El DMS actúa como autoridad de registro: autentica la solicitud, aplica la política de registro y pide a la CA que firme. El cliente conserva o recibe la clave, instala el resultado y lo presenta al consumidor."},"993":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El administrador prepara CA, perfil de emisión y DMS."},"994":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El integrador instala confianza inicial en el servidor EST y una credencial de admisión."},"995":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El cliente solicita una identidad para su `Device ID` mediante EST."},"996":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"Se comprueban certificado, vinculación al dispositivo e instalación de la pareja clave/certificado."},"997":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"El consumidor valida y autoriza la identidad; el cliente programa renovación y recuperación."},"998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#el-recorrido","content":"EST utiliza `/.well-known/est/{DMS_ID}`. Las APIs administrativas y la asignación manual siguen siendo recorridos distintos. Enrola y conecta un dispositivo completa una primera prueba con mTLS."},"999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Estrategias de aprovisionamiento\" description=\"Elige registro automático, prerregistro o asignación manual.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies\" />"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Configura el DMS\" description=\"Separa admisión, autenticación por operación, perfil y distribución.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms\" />"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","content":"<Card title=\"Identidad inicial y autenticación\" description=\"Decide qué prueba permite solicitar la primera identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity\" />"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview#para-el-administrador","conten