cionada, ID existente, algoritmo y tamaño admitidos."},"2331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Revisa la precedencia de Perfiles; CA y DMS resuelven de forma distinta."},"2332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Resultado"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Sujeto, SAN, usos y fechas adecuados."},"2334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Compara CSR, perfil y certificado; emitir correctamente no demuestra aceptación por el consumidor."},"2335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Si el certificado emitido tiene campos inesperados, revisa `Honor Subject`, `Honor Key Usage`, `Honor Extended Key Usages` y `Honor Extensions`. Esta última solo conserva SAN, sin validar el derecho a esos nombres. La validez no se recorta automáticamente al vencimiento de la CA."},"2336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Si falla la reemisión de una CA, comprueba revocación y fecha: no se admite para una CA revocada o ya vencida. Para cambiar la clave, utiliza Jerarquía y rotación."},"2337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"Revisa cada frontera por separado:"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Registro:** vuelve a leer el certificado correcto por serie y emisor. Confirma estado, razón y hora; los registros expirados o revocados definitivamente no admiten otra transición."},"2339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Endpoint:** inspecciona AIA y CDP del certificado. Consulta esas URLs desde la red del consumidor; una ruta antigua o un emisor incorrecto puede explicar la diferencia."},"2340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**OCSP:** guarda una respuesta nueva, verifica firma y tiempos y observa su estado. Un error HTTP por una serie ausente no equivale a `Good` ni garantiza un `Unknown` firmado."},"2341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**CRL:** compara `latest_crl`, número y tiempos de la lista descargada. Confirma la serie en el contenido. Si no cambia, revisa `regenerate_on_revoke`, entrega del evento, trabajos, firma y almacenamiento con el operador de Despliegue."},"2342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Cliente:** comprueba caché, política ante evidencia vencida o no disponible, extensión IDP crítica y rechazo de una conexión nueva."},"2343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"Una reactivación desde `CertificateHold` requiere una CRL nueva para que el cliente deje de ver la suspensión. Reactivar una CA no restaura su cascada de descendientes; revisa todos los estados y los errores individuales de la operación."},"2344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-cadena-se-valida-pero-la-conexión-falla","content":"Comprueba la identidad esperada, SAN, KU/EKU, clave correspondiente, intermedias enviadas y permisos del consumidor. Diferencia confianza TLS en el servidor, autenticación del cliente y autorización de la acción. Sigue Validación para una prueba positiva y otras de rechazo."},"2345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-36/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-cadena-se-valida-pero-la-conexión-falla","content":"Cuando necesites escalar un problema, entrega los identificadores, error y evidencia pública relevante, con tiempos de consulta y versión. Esto permite distinguir un fallo de emisión, de publicación o de la aplicación consumidora."}},"count":2345},"sorting":{"language":"spanish","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":866,"2":923,"3":445,"4":1932,"5":391,"6":676,"7":1523,"8":1501,"9":2089,"10":1451,"11":1737,"12":2261,"13":2203,"14":47,"15":21,"16":127,"17":394,"18":2009,"19":673,"20":1341,"21":738,"22":867,"23":1065,"24":1084,"25":6,"26":870,"27":1828,"28":1594,"29":1884,"30":1871,"31":1836,"32":1396,"33":1799,"34":2172,"35":1310,"36":504,"37":1225,"38":2173,"39":1332,"40":1995,"41":1166,"42":1484,"43":2151,"44":352,"45":332,"46":353,"47":2272,"48":806,"49":2288,"50":728,"51":1852,"52":1749,"53":2106,"54":1497,"55":891,"56":752,"57":411,"58":2126,"59":1748,"60":896,"61":2125,"62":2103,"63":2127,"64":1305,"65":1087,"66":377,"67":1800,"68":1306,"69":1088,"70":378,"71":1154,"72":1330,"73":828,"74":379,"75":731,"76":811,"77":1243,"78":475,"79":865,"80":1839,"81":439,"82":1344,"83":2003,"84":1659,"85":1841,"86":613,"87":790,"88":2325,"89":1247,"90":1699,"91":1245,"92":1249,"93":2176,"94":1372,"95":950,"96":1162,"97":559,"98":2201,"99":666,"100":612,"101":1949,"102":1252,"103":1615,"104":2192,"105":277,"106":327,"107":556,"108":275,"109":1568,"110":1246,"111":1251,"112":920,"113":769,"114":1758,"115":1140,"116":1056,"117":721,"118":1656,"119":2306,"120":1804,"121":180,"122":0,"123":1606,"124":178,"125":734,"126":2010,"127":183,"128":1237,"129":1655,"130":184,"131":279,"132":1607,"133":179,"134":239,"135":914,"136":185,"137":1521,"138":2334,"13